      "result": "* **ask-matt**: Role: QA orchestrator | Status: Installed stock | Phase: grill/terms | Collision: teach\n* **grill-with-docs**: Role: Adversarial doc-grounded QA | Status: Installed stock | Phase: grill | Collision: grilling, grill-me\n* **triage**: Role: Bug/issue routing | Status: Installed stock | Phase: plan | Collision: None\n* **improve-codebase-architecture**: Role: Heavyweight HTML reporting | Status: Installed stock | Phase: compound | Collision: workflow: codebase-audit\n* **setup-matt-pocock-skills**: Role: Installer | Status: Installed stock | Phase: prep | Collision: None\n* **to-spec**: Role: Requirements freezing | Status: Installed stock | Phase: terms | Collision: None\n* **to-tickets**: Role: Slicing into issues | Status: Installed stock | Phase: plan | Collision: None\n* **implement**: Role: Execution runner | Status: Installed stock | Phase: execute | Collision: None\n* **wayfinder**: Role: Multi-session roadmaps | Status: Installed stock | Phase: plan | Collision: ce-lite/wayfinding.md\n* **prototype**: Role: Low-fidelity exploration | Status: Installed stock | Phase: plan/execute | Collision: None\n* **diagnosing-bugs**: Role: Bug localization | Status: Installed stock | Phase: execute/verify | Collision: None\n* **research**: Role: Domain context gathering | Status: Installed stock | Phase: grill | Collision: last30days\n* **tdd**: Role: Test-driven loop | Status: Installed stock | Phase: execute/verify | Collision: None\n* **domain-modeling**: Role: Type boundary definitions | Status: Installed stock | Phase: terms/plan | Collision: None\n* **codebase-design**: Role: Module organization | Status: Installed stock | Phase: plan | Collision: graph-engineering\n* **code-review**: Role: Change reviewer | Status: Installed stock | Phase: verify | Collision: workflow: code-review\n* **resolving-merge-conflicts**: Role: Git resolution | Status: Installed stock | Phase: execute | Collision: None\n* **Gaps**: Automated handoff triggers prior to context rot; local test generators; explicit runtime feedback validators.\n* **Local-Only Strengths**: Context rot forensics and compression (poor-mans-distill); sandboxing (shard-security); harness integrity (harness-doctor); prompt formatting (prompt-sharpen, no-ai-slop); DAG mapping (graph-engineering).\n* **Dangerous Duplicates**: `grill-with-docs` vs `grill-me`/`grilling` (causes duplicate validation loops); `wayfinder` vs `ce-lite/wayfinding.md` (clashes on multi-session state tracking); Matt `code-review` vs `workflow: code-review` (collides on tool execution targeting).",
